    "atom::76f1ac5be0a9e65e1a52ad49": {
      "atom_id": "atom::76f1ac5be0a9e65e1a52ad49",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "阐明共生微生物组在多种重大疾病（代谢病、癌症、感染）中的病理生理机制，并评估基于微生物组的干预策略（尤其是工程菌）的临床潜力与应用现状。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f93d1f15b518835a0295f6e5d46e42cc5d7f720a84f73b142c87c128f1f42ce0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::7b1cd7df36e01bfb86b40ca1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7b1cd7df36e01bfb86b40ca1",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "人类共生微生物组（包括肠道、皮肤、阴道等部位）及其在代谢疾病、肿瘤和病原体感染中的医学应用，重点涵盖传统干预手段（益生菌、FMT）与合成生物学工程菌的应用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::059e2c6e3460bbdfa22f320408e2f783f6d8fbb4c84c9f3de30e36c963028348",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f1b84f22d3980cb93e7a6334": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f1b84f22d3980cb93e7a6334",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述旨在总结共生微生物组在特定疾病中的作用机制及工程菌在疾病预防、检测和治疗的最新进展。文章首先回顾了微生物组通过代谢产物（如SCFA、胆汁酸、TMAO）和炎症调节影响宿主代谢的机制，随后探讨了微生物组在肿瘤发生、转移及治疗反应（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂ICIs和化疗）中的双向作用，最后阐述了微生物组通过定植抗力抵抗病原体感染的机制。在此基础上，文章系统梳理了从非靶向干预（抗生素、饮食、FMT、益生菌）到靶向干预（工程菌作为传感器、治疗剂或诊断工具）的策略演变，并指出了工程菌临床转化面临的挑战。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2b9d9035933748ce575af728ac12a3179b82d419c6f96cae2802cc393107d224",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::990eeee11679939276207321": {
      "atom_id": "atom::990eeee11679939276207321",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
