    },
    "atom::f0e281f15110afe1e79bf83d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f0e281f15110afe1e79bf83d",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述“肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂疗效”提供了关键的背景机制和具体证据。它详细列出了与ICI响应相关的特定菌属（如Roseburia, Prevotella, Bacteroides），解释了微生物组通过激活树突状细胞和CD8+ T细胞增强免疫反应的潜在机制，并提到了微生物组对化疗药物代谢的影响。此外，它还介绍了利用工程菌增强免疫疗法效果的最新策略，可作为机制解释和前沿干预手段的素材。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f05f23305d4ae92ba7619ca6d37905f2eb7e26e60e12d1a5e57a0b97500b4469",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9461ad2e6421ce17b99301b8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9461ad2e6421ce17b99301b8",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述将代谢疾病、肿瘤和感染并列讨论，需注意区分不同疾病背景下微生物组的具体作用机制，避免混淆。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4b1768a92ccb41f3247846efd1f45bced4f111bf21a8d540b732cd6928806d16",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c417190a6aba285b31bc53e4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c417190a6aba285b31bc53e4",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "关于ICI响应的微生物标志物多为相关性研究，因果关系的确定需谨慎，且不同癌症类型的响应菌群可能存在差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::1665125cc52bd142aafc9e1a5b64a3dd5f2f4f48cbd957b6f5c0c39a5e075f43",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4b1768a92ccb41f3247846efd1f45bced4f111bf21a8d540b732cd6928806d16",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6a1e20f9c24f8d9d996dcdee": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6a1e20f9c24f8d9d996dcdee",
      "source_handle": "P0132",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "工程菌的大部分应用仍处于临床前阶段，将其机制外推到当前临床实践时需明确标注其实验性质。",
