    "atom::a0695a1653ccfa8f2a8a4475": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a0695a1653ccfa8f2a8a4475",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该机制主要在mouse models中验证；需注意的是，PD-L2也结合PD-1，作者通过抗体克隆特异性排除了PD-1结合的主要贡献，强调了RGMb的作用，但在人体中PD-L2/PD-1与PD-L2/RGMb的比例关系尚不明确。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了微生物群通过下调DCs表面PD-L2表达来增强抗肿瘤免疫的机制；并进一步发现PD-L2通过与T细胞表面的RGMb结合发挥抑制作用，而微生物的存在降低了这一抑制性互作。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::907ecf8670514a10007c75a2174b1b13632af8df73114061c6db910d05ffe16b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::4af8052ba3e9330ac9bb53d4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4af8052ba3e9330ac9bb53d4",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释微生物群如何具体调节免疫检查点分子的表达和功能，特别是作为PD-1/PD-L1通路之外的替代抑制通路（RGMb）的调节者。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7487e4ed03ba9eb9a488ddf9559b7cdea049c5536522f1923e6786f76e3cabb4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c1da304bfc43c2d641ded0b0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c1da304bfc43c2d641ded0b0",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "效果依赖于特定的肿瘤模型和微生物背景；并非所有肿瘤类型（如E0771乳腺癌）均显示联合治疗的额外获益，提示该策略具有肿瘤类型特异性。",
        "contribution": "提供了克服微生物依赖性ICI耐药的策略证据：联合使用抗PD-L2或抗RGMb抗体可恢复对PD-1/PD-L1治疗的敏感性，即使在定植了非响应者粪便的模型中也有效。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::907ecf8670514a10007c75a2174b1b13632af8df73114061c6db910d05ffe16b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::b572bdbb3c89cb641342c956": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b572bdbb3c89cb641342c956",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "作为“克服耐药性策略”部分的素材，展示靶向微生物相关靶点（而非直接靶向肿瘤或PD-1本身）的有效性。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7487e4ed03ba9eb9a488ddf9559b7cdea049c5536522f1923e6786f76e3cabb4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::18cc47a4e9db7ec92c95e9bc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::18cc47a4e9db7ec92c95e9bc",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅从复杂菌群中筛选出少数几种，且指出其他菌群可能通过不同机制（如分泌肌苷、STING激动剂等）发挥作用，因此不能代表所有微生物效应。",
        "contribution": "识别了促进ICI疗效的具体细菌物种（C. cateniformis），并证明其通过表面提取物抑制PD-L2表达，建立了特定菌群-宿主免疫分子-治疗反应的因果链。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::907ecf8670514a10007c75a2174b1b13632af8df73114061c6db910d05ffe16b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::628253db1ddff481f493d0b5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::628253db1ddff481f493d0b5",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于列举具体的“响应者相关菌群”，并说明其作用机制不仅仅是代谢产物，还包括对宿主免疫细胞表面分子的直接调控。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7487e4ed03ba9eb9a488ddf9559b7cdea049c5536522f1923e6786f76e3cabb4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d97aaa0f93cfb0f9422aff71": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d97aaa0f93cfb0f9422aff71",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了肠道微生物群影响免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的一个具体分子机制：微生物通过下调DCs上的PD-L2表达，进而减少PD-L2与T细胞上RGMb的结合，从而解除对CD8+ T细胞的抑制。这为解释“为何某些微生物组成导致ICI耐药”以及“如何通过联合用药克服耐药”提供了直接的实验证据和理论框架。特别适用于综述中关于微生物调控机制、耐药性克服策略以及新型生物标志物/靶点的讨论。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6326944d115b7c65e8d7f057c1b6ab657c4dec11f29595a0581adbcc7c3c961c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b374f443c51adcef03a06d33": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b374f443c51adcef03a06d33",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究的结论主要基于小鼠模型，尽管使用了患者粪便移植，但不能直接外推至人体内的确切疗效和安全性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::43e95c97244bc7892f5b6b0f82025dd67a82c72d1df4a18ba15738d87206bec8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::63cfbef8b6cb644b598a7d39": {
      "atom_id": "atom::63cfbef8b6cb644b598a7d39",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "PD-L2/RGMb轴的作用是在特定微生物背景下（如GF或ABX）被凸显的，在正常SPF小鼠中，由于PD-L1已能有效抑制肿瘤，联合PD-L2阻断的额外获益有限或不显著，需注意适用情境。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::43e95c97244bc7892f5b6b0f82025dd67a82c72d1df4a18ba15738d87206bec8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::95630d39569adbe802ef0f43": {
      "atom_id": "atom::95630d39569adbe802ef0f43",
      "source_handle": "P0242",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者声称RGMb在T细胞上的作用是“novel”，但这基于其之前的研究焦点主要在髓系细胞，综述中应客观表述为“补充了RGMb在T细胞功能方面的新见解”。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::50f6b2c5ac9bd691e19ea9f541284d3dea71a1ff000f8ff332560edd0e0fb6aa",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::43e95c97244bc7892f5b6b0f82025dd67a82c72d1df4a18ba15738d87206bec8",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
