    "atom::3b6917c39e00872cf55a398e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3b6917c39e00872cf55a398e",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "1. 模型构建：工程化B16-F10、LLC1和MC-38细胞系稳定表达SFB抗原片段（SFB-3340），建立合成新抗原模拟肿瘤模型。 2. 体内干预：比较SFB定植（SFB+）与无菌（SFB-）小鼠在植入上述肿瘤后，接受或不接受抗PD-1抗体治疗的肿瘤生长情况。 3. 免疫表型分析：利用流式细胞术、MHC II类四聚体染色分析肿瘤浸润淋巴细胞（TILs）和肠道固有层（SILP）T细胞的亚群分布、转录因子表达（如RORγt, T-bet）及细胞因子分泌（IFN-γ, TNF, IL-17A）。 4. 克隆谱系追踪：结合scRNA-seq和scTCR-seq，配对分析SILP和肿瘤组织中CD4+ T细胞的TCR克隆型重叠，验证肠道到肿瘤的迁移关系。 5. 功能验证：使用Il17a-Cre;ROSA-LSL-DTA小鼠条件性清除IL-17A+ T细胞，评估其对ICB疗效及CD8+ T细胞功能的影响；进行过继转移实验追踪标记T细胞的命运。 6. 对照比较：使用诱导Foxp3+调节性T细胞的Helicobacter hepaticus (Hh)作为阴性对照，比较不同菌群诱导的T细胞程序对ICB疗效的差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8335b58c0624352f71666db16871a9934f129bf1b085fd4b20439301a4b909ba",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3b1fb60c01983800f285d21e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3b1fb60c01983800f285d21e",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了肠道共生菌通过分子模拟增强ICB疗效的因果机制证据，定义了“肠道T_H17 -> 肿瘤ex-T_H17 -> CD8+ T细胞辅助”这一细胞通路。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代该机制在人类癌症患者中的普遍性或临床相关性；模型依赖于人工设计的抗原匹配，可能不反映自然感染或复杂菌群互作的全部情况；主要在小鼠模型中验证，外推到人体需谨慎。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6eff2dbc8fc9d63610beeebc17dbdd9917130d7817cf6fe9a3c4ce0eb5727813",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::d236cacc7f4c178f632ce164": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d236cacc7f4c178f632ce164",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "SFB定植 + 抗PD-1治疗 + SFB抗原表达肿瘤",
        "finding": "显著抑制肿瘤生长并延长生存期，且产生持久的记忆样保护；单独SFB定植或单独抗PD-1治疗无此效果。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c3f510e1602f88b07b3c209a00f64dd8b173fbfe5e3d4e144dbad6433a1a97d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1e3b15f8650c9346dfd46ae1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1e3b15f8650c9346dfd46ae1",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "SFB定植小鼠的肿瘤组织",
        "finding": "发现大量源自肠道的SFB特异性CD4+ T细胞浸润，其表型从肠道中的T_H17（IL-17A+）转变为肿瘤中的T_H1-like（IFN-γ+, TNF+, T-bet+, RORγt部分保留），即ex-T_H17细胞。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c3f510e1602f88b07b3c209a00f64dd8b173fbfe5e3d4e144dbad6433a1a97d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2de560c549a1dd86781a5ce1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2de560c549a1dd86781a5ce1",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "scTCR-seq与谱系追踪",
        "finding": "证实肿瘤中的ex-T_H17细胞与肠道SILP中的T_H17细胞共享相同的TCR克隆型，证明存在从肠道到肿瘤的迁移及表型重编程。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c3f510e1602f88b07b3c209a00f64dd8b173fbfe5e3d4e144dbad6433a1a97d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c337d8a90782fb8cd71b9556": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c337d8a90782fb8cd71b9556",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "条件性清除IL-17A+ T细胞",
        "finding": "消除SFB诱导的IL-17A+ T细胞前体后，抗PD-1介导的肿瘤控制被完全取消，肿瘤内CD8+ T细胞招募和功能受损，表明ex-T_H17细胞是疗效的关键介质。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c3f510e1602f88b07b3c209a00f64dd8b173fbfe5e3d4e144dbad6433a1a97d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::935d44f812e517be8cabc35c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::935d44f812e517be8cabc35c",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "H. hepaticus定植 + 抗PD-1治疗 + Hh抗原表达肿瘤",
        "finding": "未观察到肿瘤生长抑制。虽然Hh特异性T细胞也迁移至肿瘤，但其维持Foxp3+调节性表型，缺乏促炎效应功能，无法协同增强ICB。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
