      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a7c37a39865a5b0d9dfa79dc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a7c37a39865a5b0d9dfa79dc",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组调节免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效的具体分子机制素材。它详细阐述了“分子模拟”假说下的细胞级联反应：特定共生菌（SFB）诱导的肠道T_H17细胞迁移至肿瘤部位，在ICI作用下发生表型可塑性转化为促炎的T_H1-like细胞，进而辅助CD8+ T细胞发挥抗肿瘤作用。同时，通过与诱导调节性T细胞的细菌（Hh）对比，强调了菌群诱导的初始T细胞程序类型（促炎vs调节）对最终治疗结局的决定性作用。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b3e60af34accec2e0b4871565910aaeb42fb653e92fd1d46da8a7ae292d001b1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c2a8592c728805f7c0379757": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c2a8592c728805f7c0379757",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究使用的是工程化表达单一微生物抗原片段的肿瘤模型，这种“合成新抗原模拟”可能简化了真实肿瘤微环境中复杂的抗原呈递和T细胞激活过程。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0b4443a7492f1bb68251b5b898a992099426af8876f19cfd2bb48157cd82654a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cfa61256c30db627095b2c66": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cfa61256c30db627095b2c66",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "结论主要基于小鼠模型，直接外推至人类临床疗效时需考虑物种差异及人类肠道菌群的复杂性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e3a78d4894569a6b30fe168fbeb52e8a1b5dd79bc79810b37e8ca5b1b0623dba",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0b4443a7492f1bb68251b5b898a992099426af8876f19cfd2bb48157cd82654a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::39120ef45f757d09348b3b1a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::39120ef45f757d09348b3b1a",
      "source_handle": "P0388",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "SFB在人类肠道中的定植情况和免疫原性与小鼠存在差异，其在人类ICI响应中的确切角色尚属推测，本材料未提供人类队列的直接验证数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
