    "atom::e59ae63aefdb6db089c63fe8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e59ae63aefdb6db089c63fe8",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "旨在回答肠道微生物群在肿瘤免疫逃逸中扮演的具体角色是什么，以及其组成变化如何导致不同患者对肿瘤免疫治疗产生异质性响应。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1a010a44c03b92f746a654ae061e6a11319304708a7f144d2d0a0e2fdaadf6d5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2a68ec694cfc97e217d5902e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a68ec694cfc97e217d5902e",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群（Gut Microbiota）及其代谢产物对肿瘤免疫逃逸机制的影响，以及对包括实体瘤在内的多种肿瘤免疫治疗（特别是免疫检查点抑制剂ICIs和CAR-T疗法）疗效的调节作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::baca5484132b69ccf2aee87fadb05c7f12606bf92ec2b48fd04a655d2db0fe44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9c3aad0823f6b23360ce0961": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9c3aad0823f6b23360ce0961",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统阐述了肠道微生物群如何通过影响肿瘤微环境（TME）中的免疫细胞分化、功能及炎症反应来介导肿瘤免疫逃逸。文章详细讨论了微生物群通过Th17/IL-17轴、肿瘤相关巨噬细胞（TAMs）、髓源性抑制细胞（MDSCs）等途径促进肿瘤进展的机制。此外，综述还评估了肠道微生物群组成如何决定患者对免疫检查点抑制剂（如PD-1/PD-L1和CTLA-4阻断剂）及CAR-T疗法的响应差异，并探讨了通过粪菌移植（FMT）、益生菌、抗生素调控等手段优化微生物群以改善免疫治疗效果的潜力。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6979dce628e061437a838517b2af39af1482c7481f7e9e9e49323a1dc077a5ca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
