      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::75e962a29dd299c4da346332": {
      "atom_id": "atom::75e962a29dd299c4da346332",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂疗效及其机制”提供了全面的背景框架和机制解释素材。它系统地梳理了从微生物代谢物到免疫细胞表型再到最终治疗响应的逻辑链条，特别适用于解释为何不同患者对ICI响应存在差异，以及微生物群干预（如FMT、益生菌）潜在的辅助治疗价值。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7d2e34152be4f172f02eb19a9a370f0c78fa78897fa3bd85d50882f148cee501",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0bf8462aa6bbf2b6ff207457": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0bf8462aa6bbf2b6ff207457",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种肿瘤类型（CRC, HCC, MM, Lung, Pancreatic等），在引用其关于特定机制（如Th17, TAMs）的内容时，需注意区分这些机制是在胃肠道肿瘤还是远处肿瘤中被观察到的，避免将局部机制泛化为所有实体瘤的通用机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::776c56fbc3b3951143da779743c357ce8d94f544066687f9e85821c01b829c44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d1b1b56a5dff5a04297b7215": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d1b1b56a5dff5a04297b7215",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的菌群与疗效的关系存在显著的情境依赖性（例如拟杆菌在黑色素瘤中有益，在MSS-CRC中可能有害），使用时必须结合具体的癌症类型和治疗靶点进行限定，不能一概而论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::776c56fbc3b3951143da779743c357ce8d94f544066687f9e85821c01b829c44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::19d47dfb1039c15190b2b21a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::19d47dfb1039c15190b2b21a",
      "source_handle": "P0560",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "大量机制描述基于动物实验，人体内的适用性存在不确定性，综述本身也承认许多问题尚未解决，因此在规划综述时应将其视为提出假说和方向的来源，而非确凿的最终结论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a727ee3f2d2808f7e298f50d8690e2cac74446410e738cc1590c3f97c65575fe",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::776c56fbc3b3951143da779743c357ce8d94f544066687f9e85821c01b829c44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
