    "atom::e622c6e74321224f12990210": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e622c6e74321224f12990210",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "文中强调不同研究中鉴定的有效菌群并不完全一致，且这种关联在不同癌症类型和药物间可能存在差异，不能简单外推为所有微生物都增强疗效。",
        "contribution": "列举了特定微生物属（如Bifidobacterium, Akkermansia）与ICI（PD-1/PD-L1, CTLA-4）疗效相关的临床及动物实验证据，并提出了这些微生物可能通过增强新抗原免疫原性来发挥作用的假设。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3105ed068c209c5396e545b3026f91745de6d5017d4eab0be957b01797633f1c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8b0587794c7bbbe57e05d835": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8b0587794c7bbbe57e05d835",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "作为支持“微生物群影响ICI疗效”这一结论的背景证据，并引入“新抗原质量”作为中介变量的概念。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a19626c0ce20d0c10f9ab8eeffcaaf6f785bdfe8f806bbdd8283fcd4bc813782",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::628d8c050dd7fb2838887643": {
      "atom_id": "atom::628d8c050dd7fb2838887643",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述“肠道微生物群如何调节实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂疗效”提供了重要的机制性解释素材。它不直接报告新的临床试验结果，而是解释了为什么微生物群会影响疗效：通过分子模拟诱导的异源记忆T细胞交叉反应。这对于回答F2（机制）至关重要，并为F1（疗效调节）提供了潜在的生物学通路解释。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1a03c21c9e28c29ed5ffec382c38addf6ca8816f4e4a842c600de3d6ee06d88e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4c00a94f82f42ab8687a5a20": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4c00a94f82f42ab8687a5a20",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文是综述文章，其提出的“异源记忆T细胞是新抗原免疫原性主要因素”属于作者的观点和假说，并非经过严格因果验证的定论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::986756e2427d8cde4337f6d8be13603aa14e5ca0557e70a8bf1e6e58178ecd75",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8f03092b49b02e2d54b6a774": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8f03092b49b02e2d54b6a774",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中引用的微生物与ICI疗效关联的证据来自不同的研究（小鼠模型、人类队列），且涉及的菌种各异，需注意这些关联的情境依赖性，避免将其概括为普适规律。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::986756e2427d8cde4337f6d8be13603aa14e5ca0557e70a8bf1e6e58178ecd75",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f1ee31a1146b59289bf0e61c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f1ee31a1146b59289bf0e61c",
      "source_handle": "P0085",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文章重点在于机制探讨，未提供具体的临床干预数据（如补充益生菌是否直接提高新抗原疫苗疗效），因此在规划综述时，应将其定位为机制解释而非干预效果证据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::db10b53b05a00fdea360343b9e0a064a7ac55c09c6307188143e40b52856bb77",
