        "broader_review_uses",
        "connection_to_review"
      ],
      "value": "Helps frame the broader 'host factor' landscape. While the review focuses on the gut microbiome, understanding these other host factors is crucial for appreciating the multifactorial nature of ICI response and potential confounders or synergistic effects.",
