    "atom::1fd8eb8d8a18c05467339f07": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1fd8eb8d8a18c05467339f07",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "旨在解决传统AD疗法（如糖皮质激素、生物制剂）长期使用的副作用及无法根治免疫失衡的问题，探索通过调节皮肤及肠道微生物组来恢复免疫稳态的新机制和治疗途径。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::90a7be89a334e96e1925366f81c032da29c61c991d3e38f0ed39e108129c0c44",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::549c0bca352d7608049f51f8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::549c0bca352d7608049f51f8",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "特应性皮炎（AD）患者的皮肤微生态、宿主免疫反应及皮肤屏障功能之间的相互作用；涉及肠道-皮肤轴在AD发病机制中的潜在角色。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::03317d04faf1d51040341fb04db350276877f1343159fcc46a14b0d9ff9edb8c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::04e9a73dca7588ad83f3ad87": {
      "atom_id": "atom::04e9a73dca7588ad83f3ad87",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，系统分析了皮肤共生菌与宿主免疫系统在特应性皮炎（AD）稳态维持与失衡中的作用。文章首先阐述了皮肤微生物群的空间分布及其组成变化，指出金黄色葡萄球菌（S. aureus）的富集和共生菌（如表皮葡萄球菌 S. epidermidis）的减少是AD皮损的特征。接着，详细探讨了共生菌通过代谢产物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs、色氨酸代谢物）、抗菌肽分泌及受体信号通路（如TLR2、AHR）调节Th1/Th2/Th17免疫平衡的机制。文章进一步描述了“菌群失调-免疫激活-屏障破坏”的恶性循环，并评估了基于益生菌、益生元、噬菌体及粪菌移植等靶向微生物组的新型治疗策略的临床潜力与传统疗法的局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c46bec27b93ffb8c205a59b7e35b11837fe6143eebde375d25eab3a3d4ed9f25",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::0f8081b65be3ae1ee4455eac": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0f8081b65be3ae1ee4455eac",
