    },
    "atom::29fbf81a5950559cf7f1ac3a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::29fbf81a5950559cf7f1ac3a",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "研究对象为皮肤和肠道微生物，疾病为AD而非癌症；涉及的免疫通路主要为Th2/Th17/Treg，与ICI相关的CD8+ T细胞耗竭或激活机制不同。不能直接外推至ICI疗效预测。",
        "contribution": "提供了微生物组调节适应性免疫（特别是T细胞亚群极化）的详细机制案例。具体展示了共生菌如何通过代谢物（SCFAs, 色氨酸衍生物）和表面分子（PSA, LTA）影响DC细胞活化及Treg/Th17平衡。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c106f9c2ff9eecb629b57ce68cde084a6cb2bccc5b6b931e7a48e31013aed5ea",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::07c0cb9b635f625e989cbd7d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::07c0cb9b635f625e989cbd7d",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述的背景部分，说明微生物组如何作为一种免疫调节剂影响全身或局部免疫状态。可作为对比案例，展示在非肿瘤背景下微生物组如何驱动或抑制特定的免疫通路。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::415f63422f0b5da1bbc60350dd2d6ae442cff8225ec178b6997767f75da82f6a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::80e0594fb6192c6dbcbb085c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::80e0594fb6192c6dbcbb085c",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些机制是在AD炎症背景下描述的，重点在于抗炎和屏障修复，而非抗肿瘤免疫监视。具体分子通路（如JAK-STAT, STAT6）与ICI的主要效应通路（PD-1/PD-L1, CTLA-4）无直接重叠。",
        "contribution": "阐述了微生物代谢物（如SCFAs）通过表观遗传修饰（HDAC抑制）和受体信号（GPR43, AHR）调节免疫细胞功能的分子机制。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c106f9c2ff9eecb629b57ce68cde084a6cb2bccc5b6b931e7a48e31013aed5ea",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::43c9c42971f52414192e3a70": {
      "atom_id": "atom::43c9c42971f52414192e3a70",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于解释微生物组影响宿主生理状态的通用机制路径。虽然具体分子靶点（AHR, GPR43）可能与ICI机制不同，但其“代谢物-受体-基因表达”的逻辑链条具有参考价值。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::415f63422f0b5da1bbc60350dd2d6ae442cff8225ec178b6997767f75da82f6a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7623b22820300d935b5b7f6d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7623b22820300d935b5b7f6d",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文主要聚焦于特应性皮炎（AD），虽然不直接涉及实体瘤或免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs），但其关于“微生物组-免疫调节”的机制阐述（特别是Th1/Th2/Th17平衡、Treg诱导、代谢物介导的免疫耐受）可为综述提供重要的背景理论支持。它有助于解释微生物组如何通过代谢产物和抗原呈递影响适应性免疫应答，这一原理可类比或对比于肠道微生物组对ICI疗效的影响机制。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::800aab5a18d0141e9970b063aebdacb1a885f5ad1f4c7d9e10d85ff09a4a191d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f98a4601fa400af7e7804c34": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f98a4601fa400af7e7804c34",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "本文研究对象为特应性皮炎（AD），非实体瘤。其涉及的免疫机制（Th2主导）与ICI治疗中关注的抗肿瘤免疫（通常涉及Th1/CD8+ T细胞）存在显著差异，不可直接套用结论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::da25b700144355f1ed992fce239cbee4b10e38daa2a19a9c79b373bff68cfbd2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2c5f1e5c0bc588c23fb79a36": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2c5f1e5c0bc588c23fb79a36",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的肠道-皮肤轴机制主要基于AD背景下的观察，其与肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效的具体连接点（如特定菌属、代谢物）在本材料中未明确建立，需谨慎推断。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::da25b700144355f1ed992fce239cbee4b10e38daa2a19a9c79b373bff68cfbd2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9356ec5b54d3437f4a20b895": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9356ec5b54d3437f4a20b895",
      "source_handle": "P0154",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "部分机制（如AHR通路、SCFA作用）在AD中已被详细描述，但在ICI语境下是否同样关键，需结合其他专门针对肿瘤的研究进行验证，本材料仅提供平行领域的机制参考。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::cf4c1b6e827b39baa70b33a919d27d76b14fff98b1c80f2839421faa28beeee5",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::da25b700144355f1ed992fce239cbee4b10e38daa2a19a9c79b373bff68cfbd2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
