          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::40d540e7026cbd02ba57d5e6ba05706e734a11ffa4ce803a3047c77beb79210d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::52c892c3b6cd018eb8a2f462": {
      "atom_id": "atom::52c892c3b6cd018eb8a2f462",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效，但其具体分子机制尚不明确，且临床常因抗生素使用导致菌群失调从而降低免疫治疗效果。本研究试图确定特定的细菌代谢物DAT是否能作为一种可调控的手段，通过调节IFN-I信号来克服ICI治疗的个体差异和耐药性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7434219c673563cd8906d1afc7a88b433213816209d3231237178abfdaa15bc2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::556ff9367c28f081086ed707": {
      "atom_id": "atom::556ff9367c28f081086ed707",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "C57Bl/6j小鼠及Ifnar1-/-基因缺陷小鼠；恶性黑色素瘤（B16.OVA）和胰腺腺癌（Panc02）模型；肠道微生物群与宿主免疫系统的相互作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::84fc6c25960c9fd78595c60a785e1bc4b4496b5e1cff4c4ce9615ec81e4dc0f1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::646fbc28c59fc6ce0b38677d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::646fbc28c59fc6ce0b38677d",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在探讨细菌代谢物脱氨酪氨酸（DAT）作为I型干扰素（IFN-I）调节剂，能否增强实体瘤对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI，如抗CTLA-4或抗PD-1）的治疗反应。研究通过口服补充DAT，在多种小鼠肿瘤模型中评估其抗肿瘤效果，并利用广谱抗生素诱导菌群失调模型模拟临床耐药情境，同时利用IFN-I信号缺失小鼠解析其分子机制。研究发现DAT能协同ICI增强T细胞活化，且该效应依赖于宿主IFN-I信号通路，并能部分逆转抗生素引起的治疗抵抗。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4e74008a3a3e6d4d6b761d93199627c42f97415014176871a76f04dac644806a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6838df479a72b9114a197ac7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6838df479a72b9114a197ac7",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "broader_review_uses"
      ],
      "value": {
        "material": "引言部分引用了多项关于抗生素使用、菌群失调与ICI抵抗相关的临床研究及基础研究发现。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
