    "atom::952ceaf3dfa347412a52c920": {
      "atom_id": "atom::952ceaf3dfa347412a52c920",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了关于特定细菌代谢物（DAT）如何通过宿主IFN-I信号通路增强ICI疗效的详细机制证据。它特别适用于解释“微生物代谢物介导的系统性免疫调节”这一主题，并为“抗生素使用导致的免疫治疗抵抗及其潜在补救策略”提供了具体的实验数据支持。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8b0d28988919d4a8b2839b7f37d9de9b4e3e9172e67b0b37dbba488e2547c8a3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::cc0d0b328bb17e240f824a5d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cc0d0b328bb17e240f824a5d",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "DAT的作用高度依赖于宿主IFN-I信号，若综述涉及其他信号通路（如AhR），需注意区分。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a867a810e974cd3100f2ac21870cb8d51950badfdf52f6f8dea88ee81f548ac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d18001bbef37cba34d6c9141": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d18001bbef37cba34d6c9141",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "DAT在抗生素处理组的效果是“部分恢复”，而非完全逆转，不可夸大其作为菌群替代疗法的普适性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a867a810e974cd3100f2ac21870cb8d51950badfdf52f6f8dea88ee81f548ac",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::ce5a00e0b7ce348354618096": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ce5a00e0b7ce348354618096",
      "source_handle": "P0195",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "体外实验中DAT对DC的作用需要LPS共刺激，这暗示体内可能存在复杂的微生物-宿主互作背景，不能简单推断为DAT直接激活DC。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::f4dd731b745b7c3e483c254790ecac5316734e313a926d8cc187e0653c886263",
          "field_path": [
