        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于微生物组影响免疫检查点抑制剂（ICB）疗效的机制性素材，核心贡献在于从“物种组成”转向“代谢功能”，并具体阐明了两条相反的免疫调节路径：MEP通路通过HMBPP激活Vδ2 T细胞促进抗肿瘤免疫，而核黄素合成通路通过5-OP-RU激活MAIT细胞导致免疫抑制。此外，论文提出的“功能性菌群失调”概念可作为评估微生物组整体状态与ICB疗效关联的重要维度。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::623b881452a1bbc406a2e4b5ccbaee8bad2a82c4620e4cc62784608108dda1d1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a6fc0ba0bd562126f210078570f5abed1b3d99b668a65e44f76c8117b8a5fd09",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7af92243e7a7fb7ad6ae37c7a6b35f882c6de319c7456c55dd5ef2eeef5b1ef5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9acff39a4b1c1a9f04af1ee5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9acff39a4b1c1a9f04af1ee5",
      "source_handle": "P0444",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "MEP通路和核黄素合成通路的发现主要基于MMR-d/MSI-H队列的验证，虽然Microbe-ICB包含多种癌种，但在推广至所有实体瘤时需考虑肿瘤特异性的免疫微环境差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::623b881452a1bbc406a2e4b5ccbaee8bad2a82c4620e4cc62784608108dda1d1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a6fc0ba0bd562126f210078570f5abed1b3d99b668a65e44f76c8117b8a5fd09",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4f884aeeb10467ce515e5d3a7d5b3db1f600476ec47d23f80917924a880ae87b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::334d1ac0a37066e3f64b8cc6": {
      "atom_id": "atom::334d1ac0a37066e3f64b8cc6",
      "source_handle": "P0444",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "HMBPP的直接检测受限于其化学不稳定性，因此Vδ2 T细胞的激活机制主要基于细菌上清液实验和受体阻断实验，属于间接证据链。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::623b881452a1bbc406a2e4b5ccbaee8bad2a82c4620e4cc62784608108dda1d1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a6fc0ba0bd562126f210078570f5abed1b3d99b668a65e44f76c8117b8a5fd09",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4f884aeeb10467ce515e5d3a7d5b3db1f600476ec47d23f80917924a880ae87b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1c3b4a69891ab96af2e858b2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1c3b4a69891ab96af2e858b2",
      "source_handle": "P0444",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "MAIT细胞的抑制作用是在体外共培养中观察到的，临床队列中仅观察到其与核黄素水平及不良预后的相关性，直接的因果抑制效应在体内尚未完全排除其他混杂因素。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::623b881452a1bbc406a2e4b5ccbaee8bad2a82c4620e4cc62784608108dda1d1",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::a6fc0ba0bd562126f210078570f5abed1b3d99b668a65e44f76c8117b8a5fd09",
          "field_path": [
