    "atom::802c1f884941ed0c8457b5de": {
      "atom_id": "atom::802c1f884941ed0c8457b5de",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制主要在肠道局部上皮/内皮层面观察到；未涉及系统性免疫细胞（如T细胞）的具体调控细节，仅通过T细胞粘附实验间接提示内皮活化。",
        "contribution": "阐明了介导效应的具体分子机制：非响应者粪便中高丰度的LPS合成基因及其引发的TLR/NF-κB炎症通路和屏障损伤；响应者粪便中鞭毛蛋白相关基因激活TLR-5及IL-1β/IL-10通路，有助于缓解炎症。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5522b2dfc0f270e3440c121789908b0ee8ba7421dfa80210e5aa025a45e870a5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::109a8f61aa378a31321446e8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::109a8f61aa378a31321446e8",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于详细阐述微生物-宿主互作的分子路径；解释LPS作为负面调节因子和鞭毛蛋白作为潜在正面调节因子的双重角色；为开发基于微生物成分的辅助疗法（如补充鞭毛蛋白或清除LPS）提供理论依据。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4470dd22aabcea7f749ddcfcf2d1695f66f48c95864656ca2eb371114bb85426",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::071b51953b5c2be3c6f7fa4f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::071b51953b5c2be3c6f7fa4f",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物群如何通过物理屏障完整性和特定分子信号（LPS vs 鞭毛蛋白）调节宿主对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）响应的直接体外证据。它特别适用于解释“非响应者”中观察到的肠道炎症和屏障功能障碍机制，以及“响应者”中潜在的抗炎/修复机制。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::4c7799da0cca74d8959c28777cfabbf99ddc78bf4f2c7060b190af60f4540186",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b30b00ce79159478516d4ce2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b30b00ce79159478516d4ce2",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该研究使用的是黑色素瘤患者队列，结论外推至其他实体瘤需谨慎，尽管机制可能具有普遍性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e0b3c80a097385894bd99a9a03b639af81e46e6c84cc285da41007f55a9e0bb3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::643c6ec357b9497fd0ce6256": {
      "atom_id": "atom::643c6ec357b9497fd0ce6256",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "作者声称模型“预测”响应，但这主要基于体外表型与临床状态的关联，而非前瞻性临床试验验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e0b3c80a097385894bd99a9a03b639af81e46e6c84cc285da41007f55a9e0bb3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::306388750b6d8f8f1589045a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::306388750b6d8f8f1589045a",
      "source_handle": "P0073",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "LPS和鞭毛蛋白的作用是在特定浓度下验证的，体内实际浓度和时空分布可能更为复杂。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::88fdcddfb109d931e6ee0b880948bae013cc3db37a7e2c96c02e45370f5c38db",
          "field_path": [
