          "record_id": "record::7183fab48388d36a56b62d987c632c16fff03658268bd633dc3c06815dde26df",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::39d9f0d5bd2f8fd188b65f9aa1f592cf8b66e1f5006038c4de60cfe93c241455",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c1405734ac3fa39d7e68fa0e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c1405734ac3fa39d7e68fa0e",
      "source_handle": "P0166",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物群影响癌症免疫治疗反应，但其促进肠外抗肿瘤免疫的具体机制尚不清楚。特别是肠道细菌如何到达远端肿瘤部位并发挥作用，以及ICT在此过程中扮演的角色。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7183fab48388d36a56b62d987c632c16fff03658268bd633dc3c06815dde26df",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f684de9cd343f52bfbfa2bee29453d04bd7f698dc6a2905f61b283b896dece1a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::658f0d3bcb535876bc8666e1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::658f0d3bcb535876bc8666e1",
      "source_handle": "P0166",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "本研究以B16-F10皮下黑色素瘤小鼠模型为对象，研究免疫检查点阻断疗法（ICT，联合抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4抗体）对肠道微生物群向次级淋巴器官及肿瘤转移的影响及其介导的抗肿瘤免疫机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7183fab48388d36a56b62d987c632c16fff03658268bd633dc3c06815dde26df",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::950125a81f00af410c6ae2e8a29fda088375eb8799ddf049f128930c70eee68b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::43cf72be18d2f4c656a12284": {
      "atom_id": "atom::43cf72be18d2f4c656a12284",
      "source_handle": "P0166",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该研究旨在阐明肠道微生物如何促进远端（肠外）肿瘤的免疫治疗反应。作者发现ICT治疗会诱导特定的内源性肠道细菌转移到肠系膜淋巴结（MLN）、肿瘤引流淋巴结（TDLN）和肿瘤组织中。机制上，ICT通过诱导肠道炎症激活树突状细胞（DCs），DCs依赖CCR7将细菌转运至MLN；同时ICT引起MLN重塑（淋巴管生成和高内皮微静脉扩张），这有助于细菌突破“黏膜防火墙”扩散至远端组织。这些转移的细菌（如粪肠球菌、约氏乳杆菌等）进一步激活DC并促进效应CD8+ T细胞的产生，从而增强ICT疗效。抗生素处理可阻断这一过程并削弱ICT效果。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::7183fab48388d36a56b62d987c632c16fff03658268bd633dc3c06815dde26df",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::de2a9bf9b7b9bebc03f51512c48b6d20064008d5c25f8d2df18371bf8ff41878",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9c4028d7b43409e6bbc020c4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9c4028d7b43409e6bbc020c4",
      "source_handle": "P0166",
      "field_path": [
